Chapter 12: General Clifford Tapering
======================================

Symplectic representation:
  XYZ → X bits = [|true; true; false|], Z bits = [|false; true; true|]

Commutativity:
  XX and ZZ commute? true
  XZ and YI commute? false

Heisenberg model (XX + YY + ZZ + ZI + IZ):
  Diagonal Z₂ qubits: 0
  General Z₂ symmetries: 1

  FullClifford application is withheld here.
  Select generator eigenvalues from the target physical sector,
  then compare all tapered sector spectra with the untapered matrix.
